From 88207ae20ced40c2f5c9efc16bd5d26adc6de653 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 09:22:43 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 104/140] feat(browser): refine grids and improve media
 reliability

Align folder and video grids with NextPlayer spacing, support grid metadata fields, and restore folder pinning.

Fix chapter progress notifications, wallpaper startup persistence, downloaded subtitle names, and stale media scan updates.
